---
import { SCENARIO, CHECKPOINTS } from '../data/bug-walkthrough';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<section class="journey" id="what" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
  <h2 id="what-heading"><span id="journey-title">Start with SWE.</span></h2>
  <p>Kerby’s software-engineering rulebook guides your agent from understanding a task to verifying the result.</p>
  <ol class="path">{CHECKPOINTS.map((step, i) => <li><a href={url(`rulebooks/swe/bug-walkthrough/#${step.id}`)}><span class="number">{String(i + 1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>{step.stage}</a></li>)}</ol>
  <p id="arrow" class="return">If verification fails, return to investigation.</p>
  <div class="walkthrough"><p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATIVE WALKTHROUGH</p><blockquote>“{SCENARIO}”</blockquote><a href={url('rulebooks/swe/bug-walkthrough/')}>See how the agent works through it →</a></div>
  <p class="guide-link"><a href={url('rulebooks/swe/')}>Read the SWE guide →</a></p>
  <details><summary>Other rulebooks and authoring</summary><p>Rulebooks supply instructions and declare checks. <a href="https://github.com/sorawit-w/kerby/tree/main/skills/kerby/rulebooks/skill-authoring">Skill authoring</a> requires fresh evaluation of the exact skill text before presenting it as verified. You can also <a href="https://github.com/sorawit-w/kerby/blob/main/docs/AUTHORING-RULEBOOKS.md">write your own rulebook</a>.</p></details>
</section>
<style>
.journey { border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-block:2.5rem; }
h2 { margin:0 0 1rem; font-size:2rem; }
p { color:var(--secondary); }
.path { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:2rem 0 1rem; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
.path a { color:var(--text); text-decoration:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.5rem; font-size:.95rem; }
.path a:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
.number { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.7rem; color:var(--muted); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom:.5rem; }
.return { font-size:.85rem; color:var(--muted); margin:0; }
.walkthrough { margin-top:2rem; border-left:2px solid var(--structure); padding-left:1.25rem; }
.walkthrough .eyebrow { margin:0 0 .65rem; font-size:.65rem; }
blockquote { margin:0 0 .75rem; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:1.35rem; max-width:40rem; }
.guide-link { margin:1.5rem 0 .75rem; }
details { font-size:.9rem; } summary { cursor:pointer; color:var(--secondary); }
@media(max-width:600px) { .path { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; } }
</style>
